<title>USA: Texas Utilities unit to redeem B pfd stock.</title>
<headline>Texas Utilities unit to redeem B pfd stock.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas Utilities Electric Co said Monday it plans to redeem on April 21 the 440,137 outstanding shares of its adjustable-rate cumulative preferred stock, Series B, at $100 per share plus accrued dividends of $0.39 per share.</p>
<p>TU Electric is the principal subsidiary of Texas Utilities Co.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
